{"seq":2,"slug":"facts-rules-queries","title":"事实、规则与查询","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/modern-prolog-programming/foundations/facts-rules-queries","wordCount":1641,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"事实-规则与查询\">事实、规则与查询</h1><p>Prolog 程序由三种子句组成：<strong>事实</strong>断言无条件为真的关系，<strong>规则</strong>定义有条件的逻辑蕴含，<strong>查询</strong>向系统提问并触发推导。这三种子句共同构成了一个逻辑数据库——程序员的工作是填充这个数据库，运行时负责从中推导答案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>三种子句是同一形式（Horn 子句）的三种用法，理解它们的关键在于把握统一的形式与不同的角色：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>事实</strong> <code>p(a, b).</code> 是体部为空（<code>true</code>）的子句，等价于基原子公式，用于声明知识库中的已知为真关系；</li>\n<li><strong>规则</strong> <code>H :- B1, B2.</code> 是体部非空的子句，读作「若体部全部为真则头部为真」，把新关系归约到已有关系上；</li>\n<li><strong>查询</strong> <code>?- G.</code> 是被否定的目标子句，系统通过反证法证明它不可满足，从而得到变量绑定；</li>\n<li><strong>谓词</strong>=同一函子/元数的全部子句，其排列顺序直接决定搜索与回溯的行为。</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>子句类型</th>\n<th>逻辑形式</th>\n<th>何时使用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>事实</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\forall: p(a, b)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>声明已知为真的关系实例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>规则</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>←</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>∧</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H \\leftarrow B_1 \\wedge B_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">←</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>由已有关系推导新关系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>查询</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>←</mo><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\leftarrow G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">←</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>向知识库提问</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"事实-无条件的真命题\">事实：无条件的真命题</h2><p>事实是没有体部的子句，等价于逻辑中的基原子公式。每个事实声明一个特定关系实例为真：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\"%% 家族关系事实&#10;parent(tom, bob).&#10;parent(tom, liz).&#10;parent(bob, ann).&#10;parent(bob, pat).&#10;&#10;%% 属性事实&#10;male(tom).&#10;male(bob).&#10;female(liz).&#10;female(ann).&#10;female(pat).\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>%% 家族关系事实</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>parent(tom, bob).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>parent(tom, liz).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>parent(bob, ann).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>parent(bob, pat).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% 属性事实</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>male(tom).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>male(bob).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>female(liz).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>female(ann).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>female(pat).</span></span></code></pre></div><p>事实的集合构成了 Prolog 的<strong>知识库</strong>（Knowledge Base）。从逻辑视角，每个事实 <code>p(a, b).</code> 是全称闭合的原子公式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\forall : p(a, b)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（此处无自由变量，故全称量词可省略）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"带变量的事实与通配符\">带变量的事实与通配符</h3><p>事实中也可以包含变量，表示对所有值成立的关系：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\"likes(mary, _).          % Mary 喜欢一切事物&#10;equal(X, X).             % 任何事物等于自身\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>likes(mary, _).          % Mary 喜欢一切事物</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>equal(X, X).             % 任何事物等于自身</span></span></code></pre></div><p>下划线 <code>_</code> 是匿名变量——每次出现都是独立的变量，不与其他位置绑定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规则-条件推导\">规则：条件推导</h2><p>规则由<strong>头部</strong>和<strong>体部</strong>组成，中间以 <code>:-</code> 连接。读作「如果体部为真，则头部为真」：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\"%% 规则定义&#10;grandparent(X, Z) :- parent(X, Y), parent(Y, Z).&#10;sibling(X, Y) :- parent(Z, X), parent(Z, Y), X \\= Y.&#10;ancestor(X, Y) :- parent(X, Y).&#10;ancestor(X, Y) :- parent(X, Z), ancestor(Z, Y).\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>%% 规则定义</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>grandparent(X, Z) :- parent(X, Y), parent(Y, Z).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>sibling(X, Y) :- parent(Z, X), parent(Z, Y), X \\= Y.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ancestor(X, Y) :- parent(X, Y).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ancestor(X, Y) :- parent(X, Z), ancestor(Z, Y).</span></span></code></pre></div><p>规则的逻辑语义是 Horn 子句：<code>grandparent(X, Z) :- parent(X, Y), parent(Y, Z)</code> 对应 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mi>X</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>Z</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∧</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>Z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>→</mo><mi>g</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>Z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\forall X, Y, Z: parent(X, Y) \\wedge parent(Y, Z) \\rightarrow grandparent(X, Z)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"子句的组织-谓词\">子句的组织：谓词</h3><p>同一个函子/元数的所有子句（事实和规则）构成一个<strong>谓词</strong>。Prolog 从上到下尝试匹配谓词的各子句——这个顺序对程序行为有决定性影响：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\"%% ancestor/2 的两个子句构成一个谓词&#10;%% 基础情况在前，递归情况在后——这个顺序保证终止&#10;ancestor(X, Y) :- parent(X, Y).           % 子句 1：基础&#10;ancestor(X, Y) :- parent(X, Z), ancestor(Z, Y). % 子句 2：递归\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>%% ancestor/2 的两个子句构成一个谓词</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% 基础情况在前，递归情况在后——这个顺序保证终止</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ancestor(X, Y) :- parent(X, Y).           % 子句 1：基础</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ancestor(X, Y) :- parent(X, Z), ancestor(Z, Y). % 子句 2：递归</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>谓词属性</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>函子（Functor）</td>\n<td>谓词名称</td>\n<td><code>ancestor</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>元数（Arity）</td>\n<td>参数个数</td>\n<td><code>2</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>指示符（Indicator）</td>\n<td>函子/元数</td>\n<td><code>ancestor/2</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>子句数</td>\n<td>该谓词的定义子句数</td>\n<td><code>2</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"查询-触发推导引擎\">查询：触发推导引擎</h2><p>查询是用户向 Prolog 系统提出的问题。系统尝试证明查询为真，并返回使查询成立的变量绑定：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\"%% 存在性查询——是否存在&#10;?- parent(tom, bob).&#10;true.&#10;&#10;%% 变量查询——谁满足条件&#10;?- parent(tom, X).&#10;X = bob ;&#10;X = liz.&#10;&#10;%% 合取查询——多条件同时满足&#10;?- parent(tom, X), parent(X, Y).&#10;X = bob, Y = ann ;&#10;X = bob, Y = pat.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>%% 存在性查询——是否存在</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- parent(tom, bob).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>true.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% 变量查询——谁满足条件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- parent(tom, X).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>X = bob ;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>X = liz.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% 合取查询——多条件同时满足</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- parent(tom, X), parent(X, Y).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>X = bob, Y = ann ;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>X = bob, Y = pat.</span></span></code></pre></div><p>查询的执行过程是一次 SLD 归结（详见<a href=\"unification-resolution\">合一与归结原理</a>）：系统将查询视为待证明的目标，通过与知识库中的子句逐一合一来消解目标，直到所有子目标都被消解（成功）或所有可能都穷尽（失败）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"子句索引机制\">子句索引机制</h2><p>当谓词包含大量子句时，逐一尝试合一的开销不可接受。现代 Prolog 系统通过<strong>子句索引</strong>加速查找：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;查询: parent(tom, X)&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;第一参数索引&quot;}&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;tom&quot;| C[&quot;parent(tom, bob).&lt;br/&gt;parent(tom, liz).&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;bob&quot;| D[&quot;parent(bob, ann).&lt;br/&gt;parent(bob, pat).&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;变量&quot;| E[&quot;遍历所有子句&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"查询: parent(tom, X)\"] --&gt; B{\"第一参数索引\"}\n    B --&gt;|\"tom\"| C[\"parent(tom, bob).&lt;br/&gt;parent(tom, liz).\"]\n    B --&gt;|\"bob\"| D[\"parent(bob, ann).&lt;br/&gt;parent(bob, pat).\"]\n    B --&gt;|\"变量\"| E[\"遍历所有子句\"]</pre><p>SWI-Prolog 9.x 的 just-in-time 索引器支持<strong>深度索引</strong>（对嵌套结构的内部参数建立索引）和<strong>多参数索引</strong>（同时对多个参数位置建立联合索引）。9.3.25 版本进一步优化了子句数量极大时某参数只有少量可能值的情况下的失败路径性能。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>索引类型</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>支持系统</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>第一参数索引</td>\n<td>按第一个参数的顶层函子哈希</td>\n<td>所有现代 Prolog</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多参数索引</td>\n<td>多参数联合哈希</td>\n<td>SWI, YAP, SICStus</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>深度索引</td>\n<td>对嵌套参数的内部结构索引</td>\n<td>SWI 9.x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>JIT 索引</td>\n<td>运行时按实际查询模式动态建立</td>\n<td>SWI 9.x</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"谓词的确定性\">谓词的确定性</h2><p>一个查询可能有零个、一个或多个解。根据解的数量，谓词表现出不同的确定性：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\"%% 确定性谓词：恰好一个解&#10;succ(X, Y) :- Y is X + 1.&#10;&#10;%% 半确定性谓词：零或一个解&#10;member_check(X, [X|_]) :- !.&#10;member_check(X, [_|T]) :- member_check(X, T).&#10;&#10;%% 非确定性谓词：可能多个解&#10;member(X, [X|_]).&#10;member(X, [_|T]) :- member(X, T).\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>%% 确定性谓词：恰好一个解</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>succ(X, Y) :- Y is X + 1.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% 半确定性谓词：零或一个解</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>member_check(X, [X|_]) :- !.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>member_check(X, [_|T]) :- member_check(X, T).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% 非确定性谓词：可能多个解</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>member(X, [X|_]).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>member(X, [_|T]) :- member(X, T).</span></span></code></pre></div><p>确定性分析对程序优化至关重要——确定性谓词不需要创建选择点（choice point），从而避免了回溯栈的开销。SWI-Prolog 提供 <code>det/1</code> 声明来标注预期的确定性行为，编译器据此生成更高效的代码并在运行时检查违规。</p>\n<h2 id=\"否定-封闭世界假设\">否定：封闭世界假设</h2><p>Prolog 采用<strong>否定即失败</strong>（Negation as Failure, NAF）：如果一个目标不能从知识库推导出来，则认为它为假。这对应封闭世界假设——知识库包含了所有为真的信息。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\"%% \\+ 实现否定即失败&#10;unmarried(X) :- \\+ married(X).&#10;&#10;%% 注意：NAF 对未绑定变量行为不直觉&#10;?- \\+ member(X, [1,2,3]).&#10;false.   % 因为存在使 member 成功的 X，所以否定失败&#10;&#10;?- \\+ member(4, [1,2,3]).&#10;true.    % 4 确实不是列表成员\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>%% \\+ 实现否定即失败</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>unmarried(X) :- \\+ married(X).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% 注意：NAF 对未绑定变量行为不直觉</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- \\+ member(X, [1,2,3]).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>false.   % 因为存在使 member 成功的 X，所以否定失败</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- \\+ member(4, [1,2,3]).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>true.    % 4 确实不是列表成员</span></span></code></pre></div><p>NAF 不是经典逻辑否定——它是一种<strong>非单调推理</strong>。向知识库添加新事实可能使之前为真的否定结论变为假。这个语义特性在<a href=\"../applications/knowledge-representation-ai\">知识表示与 AI 应用</a>中有更深入的讨论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"动态谓词与数据库修改\">动态谓词与数据库修改</h2><p>Prolog 允许在运行时添加和删除子句，使知识库成为一个可变数据库：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\":- dynamic counter/1.&#10;counter(0).&#10;&#10;increment :-&#10;    retract(counter(N)),&#10;    N1 is N + 1,&#10;    assertz(counter(N1)).&#10;&#10;?- counter(X).       % X = 0&#10;?- increment.&#10;?- counter(X).       % X = 1\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>:- dynamic counter/1.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>counter(0).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>increment :-</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    retract(counter(N)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    N1 is N + 1,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    assertz(counter(N1)).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- counter(X).       % X = 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- increment.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- counter(X).       % X = 1</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n<th>逻辑更新语义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>asserta/1</code></td>\n<td>在谓词头部添加子句</td>\n<td>已运行的查询不受影响</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>assertz/1</code></td>\n<td>在谓词尾部添加子句</td>\n<td>当前选择点之后才可见</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>retract/1</code></td>\n<td>删除匹配的第一个子句</td>\n<td>遵循逻辑更新视图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>abolish/1</code></td>\n<td>删除谓词的所有子句</td>\n<td>完全移除谓词定义</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>动态谓词是 Prolog 的非逻辑特性之一——它们引入了状态和副作用。<a href=\"search-strategies-cut\">搜索策略与剪枝</a>中讨论的 cut 是另一个影响程序逻辑纯度的机制。现代风格倾向于尽量使用纯逻辑编程，将副作用限制在明确标记的边界层。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>事实、规则与查询共同构成 Prolog 的逻辑数据库，本文要点如下：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>三种子句统一为 Horn 子句，区别只在体部是否为空、是否被否定；</li>\n<li>谓词（函子/元数相同的子句集合）是组织单位，子句顺序决定搜索行为；</li>\n<li>子句索引让大知识库的匹配免于线性扫描，是运行时的主要优化之一；</li>\n<li>确定性分析帮助编译器避免不必要的选择点，<code>det/1</code> 声明可显式表达意图；</li>\n<li>否定即失败（NAF）以封闭世界假设实现，属于非单调推理，对未绑定变量要格外小心；</li>\n<li>动态谓词（<code>assert</code>/<code>retract</code>）引入状态，应限制在边界层，保持核心逻辑的纯度。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>若要深入运行时行为，可继续阅读<a href=\"search-strategies-cut\">搜索策略与剪枝</a>；若要了解纯逻辑风格下的关系式算术，参见<a href=\"../programming-techniques/constraint-logic-programming\">约束逻辑编程</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"事实、规则与查询","id":"事实-规则与查询"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"事实：无条件的真命题","id":"事实-无条件的真命题"},{"level":3,"text":"带变量的事实与通配符","id":"带变量的事实与通配符"},{"level":2,"text":"规则：条件推导","id":"规则-条件推导"},{"level":3,"text":"子句的组织：谓词","id":"子句的组织-谓词"},{"level":2,"text":"查询：触发推导引擎","id":"查询-触发推导引擎"},{"level":2,"text":"子句索引机制","id":"子句索引机制"},{"level":2,"text":"谓词的确定性","id":"谓词的确定性"},{"level":2,"text":"否定：封闭世界假设","id":"否定-封闭世界假设"},{"level":2,"text":"动态谓词与数据库修改","id":"动态谓词与数据库修改"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"合一与归结原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/modern-prolog-programming/foundations/unification-resolution"},"next":{"title":"搜索策略与剪枝","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/modern-prolog-programming/foundations/search-strategies-cut"}}